$DATUM 8-(3-Bromo-5-chloropyridin-4-yl)-2,8-diazaspiro[4.5]decan-1-one 57 (40
mg, 0.12 mmol),
2-(4-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)phenyl)-1,3,4-oxadiazole
(35 mg, 0.13 mmol) and Pd(dppf)Cl2.CH2Cl2 (4.7 mg, 5.8 μmol) were loaded
in a microwave vial under argon and then MeCN (2.1 mL) and 0.5 M aqueous
sodium carbonate solution (325 μL, 0.162 mmol) were added. The reaction
mixture was heated at 120 °C for 60 min under microwave irradiation. The
solvent were evaporated and the crude material was purified via Biotage
column chromatography (CH2Cl2/EtOH, 98:2 to 92:8). The title compound 70
(39 mg, 82% yield) as a white solid.
8-(3-(4-(1,3,4-Oxadiazol-2-yl)phenyl)-5-chloropyridin-4-yl)-2,8-diazaspiro[4.5]decan-1-one
(70) 1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.35-1.41 (m, 2H), 1.93-2.00 (m, 4H),
2.72-2.80 (m, 2H), 3.16- 3.22 (m, 2H), 3.29 (t, J = 6.9 Hz, 2H), 5.40
(bs, 1H), 7.47 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 2H), 8.20 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 2H), 8.23 (s,
1H), 8.48 (s, 1H), 8.51 (s, 1H); 13C NMR (126 MHz, DMSO) δ 31.0, 32.2,
38.3, 41.6, 48.0, 122.9, 127.3, 127.7, 130.7, 132.9, 141.3, 149.9, 150.9,
152.8, 155.1, 163.9, 180.2; LC (Method C) - MS (ESI, m/z) Rt = 2.07 min –
410/412 (M+H)+. ESI-HRMS: Found: 410.1381 calculated for C21H21 35ClN5O2
(M+H)+: 410.1378.
